{{define "subject"}}Reset your rss password{{end}}

{{define "text" -}}
Hi {{.Name}},

Someone, hopefully you, asked to reset the password for your rss account. Choose a new one here:

{{.URL}}

The link works for 1 hour and only once. If you didn't ask for this, ignore this email; your password hasn't changed.

{{template "text-footer"}}
{{- end}}

{{define "html" -}}
{{template "html-start"}}
<p>Hi {{.Name}},</p>
<p>Someone, hopefully you, asked to reset the password for your rss account. Choose a new one here:</p>
<p style="margin:24px 0"><a href="{{.URL}}" style="display:inline-block;padding:10px 20px;border-radius:999px;background:#111318;color:#ffffff;font-weight:600;text-decoration:none">Choose a new password</a></p>
<p style="color:#59636e;font-size:14px;word-break:break-all">Or paste this link into your browser: {{.URL}}</p>
<p>The link works for 1 hour and only once. If you didn't ask for this, ignore this email; your password hasn't changed.</p>
{{template "html-end"}}
{{- end}}
